    "text.c55d29d4ebaa": "Along-route assistance · Available API",
    "text.c9274041d876": "Java 21 · Spring Boot 4",
    "text.c9492b667341": "Planned community: posts, short videos, personal shops and linked products.",
    "text.c98a13f09714": "Public products",
    "text.c9e47e32ba83": "Along-route assistance",
    "text.cc0ad686900c": "ROUTES",
    "text.cd35aca03f4d": "No actual identity data stored · Permissions enforced by backend",
    "text.cdb99709d2cb": "ENGINEERING CONSOLE",
    "text.cecba109ff9a": "Discover products",
    "text.cefda34d78e9": "Every connection, clearly accountable.",
    "text.cf38f6e48a8f": "Based on actual detour cost and jointly agreed quotes, delivery can become more natural and flexible.",
