    "text.ec92146bce2c": "EVERYDAY IS A STORY",
    "text.ed2172fd7894": "See all",
    "text.edaaac738e28": "Learn about requests",
    "text.edfe1985aa09": "Identity and verification",
    "text.ee540686ef7a": "The running backend exposes public journeys only. Requests, pricing, matching and reservations require new endpoints.",
    "text.ef579d5b1f04": "The backend can create requests, match trips, calculate pricing and reserve a journey.",
    "text.f135429f6f90": "No matching API",
    "text.f1548603a7c2": "No need for a dedicated trip,",
    "text.f206afa690a2": "CURATED FINDS",
    "text.f2460f2b5d60": "◌ Photos, short videos and topics",
    "text.f313cfdd2764": "Identity credentials",
    "text.f3e4b63780fb": "Only real responses are displayed. Backend rules determine authorization and settlement.",
    "text.f4ca8ba64f7b": "Protected routes reject access while JWT verification is disabled.",
    "text.f4f7c1191fdb": "Backend capability notes",
    "text.f55c1f41f6b7": "LIFE IS MORE THAN SHOPPING",
    "text.f5d940c4bb95": "Post ID",
    "text.f6c82cfcce3e": "Daily life, photos, travel and video. Share moments without selling anything.",
    "text.f75dede2493a": "Content features planned",
    "text.f760a366d624": "The current backend has no independent route reservations or offer lookup endpoints. Unsupported actions remain hidden; inspect available APIs in the Service Centre.",
    "text.f85781540ac1": "All routes have matching Controller sources",
    "text.f8ef0b4c7483": "Kept only in this page session; protected routes return 403 without trusted JWT verification.",
